WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Your team already has useful skill recommendations. Put them somewhere everyone can find.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Alex saves a useful skill to the shared team library.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.000
The recommendation becomes available to the whole team.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.567
Sam finds it without asking Alex again.

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:20.567
Now see the complete workflow.

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:36.617
Alex adds the public copywriting skill to Northstar Studio, with a team note, an example prompt, and tags.

00:00:36.617 --> 00:00:38.117
The saved recommendation is now available to the whole team.

00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:47.567
Sam searches the shared library for copywriting, then copies the example prompt and install command.

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:52.567
Open the source, copy a compatible command, download a ZIP, or connect through authenticated MCP.

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:56.567
Different setups. One shared team library.

00:00:56.567 --> 00:01:00.000
Save once. Find fast. Use it your way.
